<title>USA: Northern States Financial raises payout.</title>
<headline>Northern States Financial raises payout.</headline>
<dateline>WAUKEGAN, Ill. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern States Financial Corp said Wednesday shareholders will receive a 10.52 percent increase in their semi-annual dividend to $1.05 per share, compared to the June 1, 1996 dividend of $0.95.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable December 1, record November 15.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
